Runs on the exit (US) node, which is the control node: it keeps the state
(secrets + users), renders configs for both nodes, builds per-user
subscriptions, deploys locally and to the entry node over SSH.

Only the Python standard library, openssl, ssh, rsync and docker are used.
"""

